\par\par \b \uc2 Hungarian Forint Strength May Force Rate Cuts - Agency  \b0\par\par\uc2 484 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2005\par 15:06\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 BUDAPEST (Dow Jones)--The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2  may be forced to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market over the coming days as the forint strengthens, a survey of 17 analysts by online economic news agency Portfolio.hu showed Tuesday.  \par \par \uc2 The forint has drifted within 1% of the strong end of its trading band against the euro in the past week, and is currently at HUF241.80 to the euro. The upper limit of the trading band is HUF240.01 to the euro.  \par \par \uc2 Slowing inflation and a series of expected rate cuts won't cause the forint to weaken more than a few points before summer, the analysts said.  \par \par \uc2 Inflation slowed to 4.1% on the year in January, down from 5.3% in December. The bank's key interest rate is currently 8.25%.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has come under increasing pressure to cut its key rate, but has been reluctant - some analysts say too reluctant - to cut rates sharply.  \par \par \uc2 "(The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) let this run a bit too long. They should have kept the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  around HUF245 (to the euro). The verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  that they would defend the strong end of the band surprises me," Olivier Desbarres of CSFB told Portfolio.hu.  \par \par \uc2 Emergency rate cuts and direct \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  are the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's most likely tools for weakening the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the analysts said.  \par \par \uc2 If the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is forced into cutting rates before the next meeting of the monetary policy council, it cannot cut them by less than 100 basis points, Concorde Securities analyst Janos Samu said.  \par \par \uc2 "If we get an attack on the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band (trading band against the euro) we would expect the (\b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  strongly in the \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. We could (also) see a rate cut of 200 basis points. In such a speculative environment we do not think a rate cut of 50 or 100 basis points would be enough to kill the attack," Lars Christensen of Danske Bank said.  \par \par \uc2 Regular monthly rate cuts will continue, the analysts agreed. A minimum 50 basis point cut is expected at the next rate meeting March 29.  \par \par \uc2 The market is nervous, dealers say, and an attack on the band could come at any time. If that happens, drastic measures may cause a temporary correction, but such a correction would be short-lived, ING Bank's Gyorgy Barcza said.  \par \par \uc2 "Even if there is a major correction in the forint, it will be only transitional," Barcza said.  \par \par \uc2 Raiffeisen Bank's Bence Lanyi thinks the pressure will ease as the trend of disinflation turns around in the summer and the problem of budget balances jump to the fore. The Hungarian government is expected to create an election budget ahead of the general elections in 2006.  \par \par \uc2 -By Marton Dunai, Dow Jones Newswires; +361-267-0623; marton.dunai@dowjones.com [ 01-03-05 1406GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020050301e131000rs\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
