\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 2-Hungary c.bank steps in to defend forint band. \b0\par\par\uc2 531 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Januar 2003\par 13:09\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST, Jan 15 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (NBH) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to defend the forint's trading regime on Wednesday, buying large batches of euros from domestic banks. \par \par \uc2  The NBH has to step in when the forint hits the top of its 30 percent wide trading band of 234.69 against the euro. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was the first since the band was widened in May 2001, part of a series of measures to prepare Hungary for membership of the euro single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , possibly in 2007. \par \par \uc2  Hungary is central Europe's only European Union candidate to have already adopted a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime matching the Exchange Rate Mechanism (ERM-2), effectively the euro zone waiting room. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the NBH began \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  at around 1030 GMT. \par \par \uc2  "Domestic banks started selling euros in batches of 10 million to the (\b \highlight22\uc2 central) bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," one dealer at K&H Bank said. \par \par \uc2  NBH spokesman Gabor Missura later confirmed the bank was buying euros for forints. \par \par \uc2  There was no immediate indication of how much the NBH may have spent in the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  INFLATION GOAL \par \par \uc2  The NBH, whose primary goal is to check inflation, earlier signalled it would rather \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  than cut interest rates which, at 8.50 percent, are the highest in the region and offer a carry of over 550 basis points against the euro. \par \par \uc2  The bank has so far fended off pressure to cut rates because of the stronger forint, despite howls of protest from exporters, who traditionally drive Hungary's economic growth. \par \par \uc2  But NBH Governor Zsigmond Jarai has said the NBH cannot risk a weaker \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , given a ballooning budget deficit of over nine percent of GDP last year and fast rising wages. \par \par \uc2  Jarai, speaking during a central bankers' conference in Vienna, said he saw no room to cut rates for now, adding a relatively strong forint was needed to hit the bank's tough 4.5 percent end-2003 inflation goal. \par \par \uc2  The forint, which has risen around 12 percent against the euro since May 2001, has been knocking at the top of its band for days, briefly breaching the 234.69 level on Monday, but only after 1400 GMT, when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had already closed. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday, the forint  closed at 234.75/80 to the euro. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  gained strength on Wednesday after December data showed year-on-year inflation at 4.8 percent, better than the 5.1 percent many in the markets had forecast. \par \par \uc2  By 1150 GMT, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  had eased back a touch, quoted at 234.66/235.16 to the euro. \par \par \uc2  The forint's protracted strength has prompted speculation the NBH and the centre-left government may be forced to revalue the flotation band, but Finance Minister Csaba Laszlo has stressed he sees no revaluation for at least 18-24 months. \par \par \uc2  Hungary is expected to join the EU in May 2004 and would be keen to go into the ERM-2 around the same time. \par \par \uc2  The forint has been pushed higher by heavy foreign capital - one local estimate puts this as high as eight billion euros - chasing high-yielding bonds ahead of gradual convergence with lower EU rates. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030115dz1f00m8f\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
