\par\par \b \uc2  ECOFIN:  \highlight22\uc2 Hungary \highlight\uc2  To Run  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Intervention \highlight\uc2  Only In Euros \b0\par\par\uc2 259 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 April 2002\par 15:22\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2002, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  OVIEDO, Spain -(Dow Jones)- The Hungarian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  intends to conduct future \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market exclusively in euros, National Bank of Hungary Governor Zsigmond Jarai said Sunday. \par \par \uc2  The decision was made recently due to the important role of the euro in Hungary's economy and financial markets. More than 80% of the volume traded in the country's interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is in euros, and conducting \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in euros would heighten transparency for markets, Jarai noted. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets at all in 2001, nor has so far in 2002. Jarai was speaking at a euro seminar of central bankers, officials and business leaders at this weekend's informal Ecofin meeting. \par \par \uc2  Hungary is one of up to 10 accession countries seeking European Union membership in 2004, and it would like to join the euro zone "as soon as possible," Jarai said, indicating a target date of 2007. \par \par \uc2  After joining the E.U., accession countries must fully meet the economic and fiscal criteria spelled out in Maastricht Treaty. What's more, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  of accession countries must enter a trading band against the euro known as the exchange rate mechanism, or ERM II, for at least two years before they can join the euro zone. \par \par \uc2  "We also accept and we believe it's a good decision to wait at least two years in the ERM II system," Jarai said. \par \par \uc2  -By Charlene Lee, Dow Jones Newswires; (49 160) 742 8059; charlene.lee@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020020414dy4e0009m\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
