d\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par to post a net loss of 755 million forints ($2.67 million) in\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par January-September, according to the median forecast of five\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par analysts in a Reuters poll on Tuesday. In the first nine months\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par of 2000 Synergon posted a loss of 179 million forints.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par * The Budapest Stock Exchange said on Tuesday that it suspended\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par trading in the shares of hotel chain Eravis Szalloda es\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Vendeglato Rt for the full session.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  All BSE funds......................\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Index to Hungarian company RICs....\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Diary of Hungarian shareholders....\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Net loss leaders.. .. BUX index..............\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Pct gain leaders....          Pct loss leaders.....\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  OTC weekly turnover................\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  CESI Central European Share Index..\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  ----------- COMMODITIES ------------- ----------------\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par * Hungary will purchase up to 500,000 tonnes of maize in a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par state \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  scheme at 18,000 forints per tonne price, the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Ministry of Agriculture said on Tuesday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par * Hungarian maize futures gained slightly on Tuesday while\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par wheat futures mostly eased, amid continuing uncertainty over a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par planned state \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the maize market, traders said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par - ECONOMIC INDICATORS --\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par * \f28 \b \hig