\par\par \b \uc2  Hungary forint eases in early trade on energy bills. \b0\par\par\uc2 253 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Juni 2001\par 10:16\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST, June 27 (Reuters) - The Hungarian forint was a touch weaker in early trade on Wednesday, pulled down by euro purchases due to usual end-of-month payments of energy bills, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "I think the weakening is due to the month-end fuel bill payments," one dealer said. \par \par \uc2  At 0800 GMT the forint traded at 11.21 percent above parity within its 30 percent wide flotation band, compared with Tuesday's close at 11.36 percent above the midline, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Against the euro, the forint traded at 243.55/70, compared with 243.10/30 on Tuesday, while against the dollar it traded at 281.50/282.00, compared with 281.90/282.00. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the forint may strengthen in the medium term, unless the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  decides to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "Unless an unexpected move, like an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  happens, I expect a strengthening to remain the forint's underlying trend," said Zoltan Szabo, dealer at WestLB. \par \par \uc2  Finance Minister Mihaly Varga told Reuters on Tuesday that \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not yet plan any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the forint despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's recent strengthening. \par \par \uc2  But he said the forint's continued appreciation might raise concerns among exporters. \par \par \uc2  The forint floats in a 15-percent-wide range on either side of a parity rate set daily by the National Bank of Hungary against a euro curency basket. From April 1, 2001, the forint is devalued every working day at a 0.2 percent monthly rate. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010712dx6r00r41\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
