\par\par \b \uc2  TUESDAY IN BRIEF - Hungary - June 27. \b0\par\par\uc2 546 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Juni 2001\par 07:34\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2     * LONDON - The recently-liberalised forward market is the \par \par \uc2  best place to profit from further forint strength and get \par \par \uc2  exposure to Hungary, according to foreign investors and \par \par \uc2  analysts. \par \par \uc2     * Hungary's state pension system reform, announced by the \par \par \uc2  Prime Minister on Sunday, will have self-care as its most \par \par \uc2  important new element, apart from being fair and transparent, \par \par \uc2  Finance Minister Mihaly Varga said on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2     * The National Bank of Hungary and the Central Statistical \par \par \uc2  Office will launch a joint core inflation index as of February \par \par \uc2  15, 2002, officials of the two institutions said on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2     * JENA - Chancellor Gerhard Schroeder said on Tuesday he \par \par \uc2  would continue to press for the European Union to take in new \par \par \uc2  members in eastern Europe since that was particularly in \par \par \uc2  Germany's economic interests. \par \par \uc2   --------- FORINT ----------------------------------- \par \par \uc2     * \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not yet plan any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the \par \par \uc2  forint despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's recent strengthening, Finance \par \par \uc2  Minister Mihaly Varga told Reuters on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    * Hungary's forint\tab \tab \tab closed at its strongest\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par level yet on Tuesday at 11.36 percent above parity, marked by\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par high turnover in the morning which eased later in the day,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dealers said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Against the euro the forint closed at 243.10/30, compared to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Monday's close at 243.50/70. Versus the dollar the forint\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par finished at 281.90/282.00, strengthening from 283.20/45.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Forint/dollar quotes...............\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  forint fixings........\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  --------- INTEREST RATES, BONDS ---- ----------------\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    * Hungarian government bond prices strengthened in the two-\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par and three-year segment of the yield curve on modest domestic\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par purchases in an otherwise quiet day, traders said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    * Overnight rates finished at around 12.10/30 percent,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par compared with Monday's 13 percent, they said, adding that rates\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par were likely to ease further in the rest of the week.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    * The average annual yield on Hungary's three-month discount\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par treasury bills was set by auction at 10.69 percent on Tuesday,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par up from 10.67 percent set at an auction one week ago, the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Government Debt Management Agency (AKK) said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  O/N rates..........................\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  T/N  rates.........................\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  NBH repo/reverse repo rates........\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  NBH one-year bond yield............\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Planned govt securities auctions...\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  T-bill auctions....................\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Bond auctions......................\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  T-bill prices...............