\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 1-Hungary c.bank - forint too strong, but no action. \b0\par\par\uc2 499 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Juni 2001\par 16:00\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  (Adds dealers' comments, background, forint quotes from para 6 on) \par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST, June 27 (Reuters) - The National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Wednesday the forint was too strong but there would be no open-market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  before it hit the strong end of the band at 15 percent above parity. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  but believes the forint is too strong," NBH spokesman Gabor Missura told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  "The present exchange rate of the forint is already (firm) enough to meet the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's inflation target," he added. \par \par \uc2  "There is no internal band," Missura said, referring to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's stance - voiced when the band was widened on May 4 - that the bank would not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  unless the forint hits the strong end of the band. \par \par \uc2  This was the second verbal warning from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , after last Friday NBH deputy general manager Zsolt Ersek said the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  should not firm further after a recent rally lifted the unit more than nine percentage points in its new 30-percent-wide flotation band. \par \par \uc2  On Wednesday at 1310 GMT the forint surged to a new all-time high at 11.65/70 percent above midline, up from 11.21 percent in early trade. \par \par \uc2  "The forint is strengthening like the devil," said Attila Behan, trader at K&H Bank. Against the euro the forint was trading at 242.35/55, up from 243.55/70 in the morning. Versus the dollar it stood at 281.20/50, firming from 281.50/282.00. \par \par \uc2  FOREIGNERS BUYING FORINT \par \par \uc2  "Foreigners are buying the forint," Behan said, adding that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's warning went unnoticed on the market. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday analysts said the NBH might be forced to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to stop the forint strengthening further if verbal warnings did not do the trick. They said an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would probably come when the forint hits around 13 percent above midline in the band. \par \par \uc2  Earlier on Wednesday dealers said the forint may firm further in the medium term, unless the NBH decides to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "Unless an unexpected move, like an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  happens, I expect a strengthening to remain the forint's underlying trend," said Zoltan Szabo, dealer at WestLB. \par \par \uc2  The forint has firmed steadily since the NBH overhauled its monetary regime by widening the forint trading band in May, making it fully convertible in mid-June and launching an inflation-targeting policy. \par \par \uc2  Finance Minister Mihaly Varga has also said this week that \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not yet plan any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the forint despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's recent strengthening. \par \par \uc2  But he said the forint's continued appreciation might raise concerns among exporters. \par \par \uc2  The forint floats in a 15-percent-wide range on either side of a parity rate set daily by the NBH against a euro \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket. From April 1, 2001, the forint has been devalued every working day at a 0.2 percent monthly rate. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010712dx6r00rzn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
