\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Hungary \highlight\uc2  forint  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  not yet on agenda-FinMin. \b0\par\par\uc2 256 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Juni 2001\par 11:57\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST, June 26 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not yet plan any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the forint despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's recent strengthening, Finance Minister Mihaly Varga told Reuters on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  But he said the forint's continued appreciation might raise concerns among exporters. \par \par \uc2  "I think that we are slowly approaching the limit, which might raise some concerns in those participants of the economy which are exporting and are exporting using domestic raw material," he told Reuters on the sidelines of a news conference. \par \par \uc2  "But I think this level is still within the limit we signalled earlier, thus any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is not on the agenda for the time being," he said. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday the forint opened at 11.40 percent above parity in its 30-percent wide flotation band. The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  closed at 11.26 percent above midline in its band on Monday, after rising as high as 11.50 percent during the day. \par \par \uc2  The Hungarian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been strengthening since May 4, when its flotatation band was widened to 15 percent either side of a central parity from 2.25 percent. \par \par \uc2  The widening was part of a general overhaul in the monetary system on preparations for Hungary's eventual European Union and European Monetary Union memberships. \par \par \uc2  The forint, however, has apparently strengthened more than expected by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which last Friday verbally \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken it. The verbal "warning", however, failed to have a long-lasting impact on the Hungarian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which resumed a firming trend on Monday. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010712dx6q00y1u\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
