r growth potential had been priced in after a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par recent rally.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par * Shares in Hungarian tile maker Zalakeramia\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par outperformed the BUX index on Tuesday on ongoing speculation\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par that the company would reschedule a burdensome $50 million loan.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par All BSE funds......................\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par * Eastern European telecoms stocks are riding high on\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Internet-related buying and are set to soar further, but\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par analysts say that with few locals online they cannot approach\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the stunning valuations seen in the west.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par * Foreign investors boosted their holdings in both Hungary's\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par equity and government securities market in the last quarter of\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1999, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said in a statement on\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Tuesday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Index to Hungarian company RICs....\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Diary of Hungarian shareholders....\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Net loss leaders.. ..   BUX index..............\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Pct gain leaders....    Pct loss leaders.....\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  OTC weekly turnover................\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  CESI Central European Share Index..\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  ----------- COMMODITIES -------------\tab     ----------------\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  ----------- ECONOMIC INDICATORS ------  ---------------\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par * The National Bank of Hungary's (NBH) 50-basis-point rate cut\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par last week has eased pressure on the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to widen the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par forint's 4.5-percent-wide \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  band, Citibank Securities\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par said on Tuesday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  ----------- ENERGY -------------------   ----------------\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  ------------OTHER \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 HUNGARY\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  NEWS-------------------------------\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Hungarian diary......\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Hungarian events diary.............\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Hungarian Press Digest.............\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     ***DOMESTIC POLITICS, GENERAL NEWS***\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     ALL PAPERS\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     - Speaking after meeting with EU Enlargement Commissioner\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Gunter Verheugen, Prime Minister Viktor Orban on Monday\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par denounced what Joerg Haider, leader of Austria's Freedom Party,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par said that EU expansion was only desirable once real wages in\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par candidate countries had reached EU levels.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par - Foreign Minister Janos Martonyi proposed at a Budapest\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par conference on Balkans stability, that post-war reconstruction\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par projects should not exclusively be directed towards the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par South-East Europe region, but should also cover countries\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par linking the region to the rest of Europe, including Hungary.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par - President Arpad Goncz highlighted the plight of Hungarian\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par minorities living in the region during his private audience with\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Pope Paul II on Monday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par - Environmentalists testing the Tisza and Szamos rivers fear\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par that a second disaster will affect the rivers, as testing of the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par river bed has revealed 15 heavy metals, some at 180 times the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par permitted levels in certain areas.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par - Officials at the Interior Ministry say they will closely\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par examine all claims for flood relief submitted by local\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par authorities, because mistakes have been made in the past and\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par authorities have overestimated flood damage costs.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     - Monday's talks on amendments to the abortion law indicate\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par that there is all-round party consensus about the changes.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     - Police officials in Budapest confirmed a report in\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Monday's New York Times that the FBI will open its first foreign\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par office in Budapest next month.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     - Imre Nagy, former owner of the liquidated Ybl Bank, was\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par arrested in Vienna on Friday. Nagy was sentenced to four years\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par imprisonment in 1996 but disappeared in 1997.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     ***BUSINESS AND FINANCE***\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     ALL PAPERS\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     - The National Bank of Hungary warned several commercial\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par banks on Friday to lay off speculating on the forint. Recently,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par an increasing number of commercial banks have been taking out\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  loans, exchanging them for forints, and placing\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par them in two-week deposits at the National Bank.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par - Motorway construction work must restart by April 1 or\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par those responsible for the delay must resign, Economics Minister\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Gyorgy Matolcsy told Parliament's Economics Committee on Monday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par - Construction industry output was 792.2 billion forints in\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1999, which makes for 17 percent growth at current prices, and\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 6.1 percent when adjusted for inflation.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par - Commercial station TV 3 said a final farewell to its\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par viewers on Monday as Scandinavian Broadcasting System, which\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par also owns TV 2, announced that it would no longer finance its\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par losses.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par - A three-month test steel production run finally began on\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Monday at the Diosgyor Steel Works, which has lain idle since\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par December 20.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par - Insurance company Hungaria achieved over 87 billion\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par forints in premium revenues last year, according to preliminary\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par figures.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     - Altalanos Ertekforgalmi Bank took out a $40 million\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par syndicated loan at the beginning of February.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     NAPI GAZDASAG\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     - The court of arbitration on Monday ordered Civis '95 and\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Budapest Novekedesi Alap, two funds managed by Budapest Bank's\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par fund manager Budapest Alapkezelo, to pay 1.95 billion forints in\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par outstanding debts to the now defunct brokerage LaSalle.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     - Cofinec's    net profits were up from $975,000 to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par $2.95 million in 1999.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     - Pharmaceutical manufacturer Humet\tab \tab  closed its\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par first profitable year in 1999 with a 35 million forint profit.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     **********\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Looking for more information from local sources? Reuters\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Business Briefing has 14 Hungarian sources including Napi\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Gazdasag, Vilaggazdasag and Magyar Hirlap. For details of the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par product please call your local help desk\tab \tab  .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ((Budapest newsroom ++ 36 1 327 4040\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par budapest.newsroom@reuters.com)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 2000.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw2n06z5y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
